{"6":[{"k":"li","t":"3. GENERAL INFORMATION"},{"k":"p","t":"A. Self Tests and Adjustments."},{"k":"p","t":"AUTOMATIC SELF TEST: The Lock-On game has a self test mode that checks the system hardware for possible failures. This test runs automatically upon power up before allowing the game to enter the Attract Mode. If an error is detected during this test, the proper error message (see table 1) will be displayed on the screen."},{"k":"p","t":"MANUAL TEST MODE: Access the Test Mode by flipping the Test Switch (see figure 1) to the ON position. In this mode, you can check the operation of the player controls and view all current option settings. Changes made to the Operator Selectable Options while in the Test Mode will be immediately reflected on the screen. This mode will also display any Hardware Error Status codes in the event there is a failure detected."},{"k":"p","t":"TABLE 1 HARDWARE STATUS ERROR CODES"},{"k":"p","t":"RAM"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   TFOLL   RAM   52,59"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   TFO12   RAM   30,31"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   TFO11   ROM   95,96"},{"k":"tr","t":"5   TFOLL   ROM   88,89"},{"k":"tr","t":"6   TFO11   ROM   76,77"},{"k":"tr","t":"7   TFO11   RAM   33"},{"k":"tr","t":"8   TFO11   ROM   24"},{"k":"tr","t":"9   TFO13   RAM   31,34"},{"k":"tr","t":"10   TFO13   ROM   29,32"},{"k":"tr","t":"11   TFO13   ROM   30,33"},{"k":"tr","t":"12   TFO14   RAM   29,44"},{"k":"tr","t":"13   TFO14   ROM   31,46"},{"k":"tr","t":"14   TFO11   INTERRUPT   94"},{"k":"tr","t":"20   TFO13   RAM   31,34"},{"k":"tr","t":"21   TFO13   ROM   29,32"},{"k":"tr","t":"22   TFO13   ROM   30,33"},{"k":"tr","t":"23   TFO13   RAM   98,99"},{"k":"tr","t":"24   TFO13   RAM   112,113"},{"k":"tr","t":"25   TFO13   INTERRUPT   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"29   TFO13   CPU ACCESS   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"30   TFO14   RAM   29,44"},{"k":"tr","t":"31   TFO14   ROM   31,46"},{"k":"tr","t":"32   TFO14   RAM   39,54"},{"k":"tr","t":"39   TFO14   CPU ACCESS   6"},{"k":"p","t":"PAGE 4 LOCK-ON OPERATION & SERVICE M